 university, student, art, theatre, and music events and can be filtered by type, topic, or building.","source_url":"https://www.otterbein.edu/campus-calendar/","source_title":"Campus Calendar | Otterbein University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Each event sets its own attendance requirements and timing; confirm the individual listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
